erId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3684794546,"text":"月が昇っては沈む…長いね。","nextNodeIds":[760540310]},{"nodeId":760540310,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1979952002,"text":"私たちの月、お互いに譲らないね。","nextNodeIds":[760540311]},{"nodeId":760540311,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2578700082,"text":"…引き分けかな？","nextNodeIds":[760540312]},{"nodeId":760540312,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":977090114,"text":"直感よりも思考タイプなんだね。ゆっくり考えていいよ。","nextNodeIds":[760540313]},{"nodeId":760540313,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1877855882,"text":"「月」をどうやって「夜空」に置けばいいのかわからなくなった？手伝おうか？","nextNodeIds":[760540314]},{"nodeId":760540314,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":4214694458,"text":"このゲーム、つまらなかった？私は面白いけど…","nextNodeIds":[760540315]},{"nodeId":760540315,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3533271682,"text":"ん？もしかして私を見てる？","nextNodeIds":[760540316]},{"nodeId":760540316,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":711050466,"text":"私の顔に…「月」の答えが書いてある？","nextNodeIds":[760540317]},{"nodeId":760540317,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":984229522,"text":"盤面はそっちだよ。","nextNodeIds":[760540318]},{"nodeId":760540318,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2451451226,"text":"うん、キミの「月」の勝ち。","nextNodeIds":[760540319]},{"nodeId":760540319,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2469296050,"text":"この夜空はキミのものだよ。","nextNodeIds":[760540320]},{"nodeId":760540320,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1333058314,"text":"あっ…しまった…","nextNodeIds":[760540321]},{"nodeId":760540321,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"暗転","textMapHash":391591778,"text":"コロンビーナと楽しい時間を過ごした…","nextNodeIds":[760540322]},{"nodeId":761210202,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1421573674,"text":"三つの月がつながった…","nextNodeIds":[761210203]},{"nodeId":761210203,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3440586410,"text":"どうしたんだ？今のゲームのことを考えてるのか？","nextNodeIds":[761210204]},{"nodeId":761210204,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":4069227426,"text":"えっと…ただ、このゲームって不思議だなって思って。","nextNodeIds":[761210205]},{"nodeId":761210205,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":3660515962,"text":"そうだな。おまえが授かった三つの月の力って、夜空を支配するレベルを遥かに超えてるもんな。","nextNodeIds":[761210206]},{"nodeId":761210206,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2291527930,"text":"うん。もし三人の女神が意見が分かれてなかったら、世界は違う運命を辿ったのかも。","nextNodeIds":[761210207]},{"nodeId":761210207,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2035085274,"text":"月の女神ってどんな印象だった？","nextNodeIds":[761210208]},{"nodeId":761210208,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2326940754,"text":"そうだね…最初に会ったのは虹月の女神、ソネット姉さま。想像してたよりも活発な性格で、やんちゃな妹みたいだった。","nextNodeIds":[761210209]},{"nodeId":761210209,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2590589898,"text":"恒月の女神、アリア姉さまは三人の中で一番落ち着いてて、リーダシップがあって…優しい神だった。あ、ラウマと雰囲気が似てるかも。","nextNodeIds":[761210210]},{"nodeId":761210210,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1346145146,"text":"霜月の女神、カノン姉さまは…知恵と先見の明のある女神だった。最初に月を私に託そうとしてくれたのも彼女だよ。","nextNodeIds":[761210211]},{"nodeId":761210211,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":955431050,"text":"みんな優しい神だったんだね。","nextNodeIds":[761210212]},{"nodeId":761210212,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":2855047562,"text":"うん、考え方の違いはあっても…みんなテイワットが、この「家」が大好きだった。","nextNodeIds":[761210213]},{"nodeId":761210213,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3088727962,"text":"私がテイワットの未来について話すと、ほっとした表情で耳を傾けてた。この世界に豊かな未来が訪れることを、心から喜んでた。","nextNodeIds":[761210214]},{"nodeId":761210214,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":1259048946,"text":"だからこそ、私に力を授けてくれたんだと思う。「家」に帰れるようにって。","nextNodeIds":[761210215]},{"nodeId":761210215,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":953885122,"text":"そっか…もし会えるなら、ありがとうって言いたいな…","nextNodeIds":[761210216]},{"nodeId":761210216,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":294831642,"text":"私も。でも…たぶん、無理だろうね…","nextNodeIds":[761210217]},{"nodeId":761210217,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHash":3096746082,"text":"幸い、世界は前に進み続けてる。彼女たちに守られた人類もちゃんと生き延びて、月の三女神の物語を語り継いでる。","nextNodeIds":[761210218]},{"nodeId":761210218,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1234052050,"text":"そうだな！毎日精一杯生きて、悪党からこの世界を守ることが、女神たちへの一番の恩返しになると思うぞ！","nextNodeIds":[761210219,761210220]},{"nodeId":761210219,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2732958530,"text":"パイモンの言う通り。","nextNodeIds":[761210221]},{"nodeId":761210220,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1591137154,"text":"パイモンも毎日精一杯生きてる？","nextNodeIds":[761210221]},{"nodeId":761210221,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":4158353418,"text":"おう！毎日を楽しく過ごす——これがオイラのモットーだからな！","nextNodeIds":[761210222]},{"nodeId":761210222,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1322681226,"text":"コロンビーナも、毎日ちゃんと食べて寝て、元気に過ごすんだぞ。それと、ゲームがしたくなったらいつでもオイラたちを呼んでくれ！","nextNodeIds":[761210223]},{"nodeId":761210223,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1318,"speakerName":"「少女」","textMapHa